From 1959163ce5e6012ce2de43cda8839354e4ef377f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: repro-up <repro-up@local>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 17:31:38 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] Ignore generated example outputs and figures

_scripts/outputs/ (pkl/json/figures produced by stereo_cal.py, poly6_example.py,
...) and figs/ (plot_tools.savefig default dir) are generated artifacts and
should not be committed; '*.pkl' alone did not cover the json/png/nested dirs.
---
 .gitignore | 4 +++-
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/.gitignore b/.gitignore
index f59e255..e40f316 100644
--- a/.gitignore
+++ b/.gitignore
@@ -4,4 +4,6 @@ build/
 src/*.egg-info/*
 __pycache__
 .coverage
-spec-file.txt
\ No newline at end of file
+spec-file.txt
+_scripts/outputs/
+figs/
